{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22111","headline":"夏日独直寄萧侍御 · 白居易","name":"夏日独直寄萧侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宪台文法地，翰林清切司。\n鹰猜课野鹤，骥德责山麋。\n课责虽不同，同归非所宜。\n是以方寸内，忽忽暗相思。\n夏日独上直，日长何所爲。\n澹然无他念，虚静是吾师。\n形委有事牵，心与无事期。\n中臆一以旷，外累都若遗。\n地贵身不觉，意闲境来随。\n但对松与竹，如在山中时。\n情性聊自适，吟咏偶成诗。\n此意非夫子，余人多不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}